'''2nd Round: Dusk (Normal)''' is one of the possible [[Continuation Stage]]s that derive from [[First Round (Easy)]] that is a part of [[The Proving Grounds]]. Beating this stage allows the access of two, random Continuation Stages. The possible Continuation Stages include:
*[[3rd Round: Dawn (Hard)]]
*[[3rd Round: Dusk (Hard)]]

